# House Hlaalu: "Odirniran" (HH_Odirniran), Edryno Arethi, Vivec.
# Edryno sends the player to the Telvanni-held ruin (10); Remasa Othril in Odirniran asks for her sister (30);
# Vedelea Othril in the Tower follows ("travel together", "Yes" 1: 50) and her own script (vedeleaFollow) logs 70
# within 512 of Remasa, once Milyn Faram, the necromancer, is dead (her line); Remasa thanks the player (90); Edryno pays (100).
# Vedelea is locked in a barred cell (door 053EDEBD, lock 60, key_Odirniran on Milyn Faram: taking it stands in
# for looting him); a closed cell left every walk standing (run hh16, probes tower_walk 1-3). She really walks:
# cell door -> Tower door 05E27081 -> Odirniran -> the hall door 058882EE (lock 30, the same key) -> Remasa. A
# closed locked door stops an AI walk short (hh17-19: settled at 63 3571). Tower walk predicted: reached, via the
# cell door; the Odirniran walk predicts a false "ceiling below body height" stall at the landing (calibration gap).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_odirniran_start
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask Odirniran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -333 3500 -1251 0 "Odirniran"
until 300 GetPCCell "Odirniran" == 1
approach 05994AFF
talk remasa othril
ask Odirniran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran == 30
bye
end

case hh_odirniran_necromancer
defend
run
player->PositionCell 485 1063 -758 0 "Odirniran, Tower"
until 300 GetPCCell "Odirniran, Tower" == 1
approach 0532FB4E
console 0532FB4E.kill
wait 60
run
"milyn faram"->RemoveItem key_Odirniran 1
player->AddItem key_Odirniran 1
expect player->GetItemCount key_Odirniran == 1
end

case hh_odirniran_rescue
defend
run
player->PositionCell -1500 3480 -1408 0 "Odirniran, Tower"
until 300 GetPCCell "Odirniran, Tower" == 1
activate 053EDEBD
wait 60
approach 052D2BEF
talk vedelea othril
ask travel together
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran == 50
bye
walk -60 4330 -1280
until 3000 "vedelea othril"->GetDistance player < 500
activate 05E27081
until 600 GetPCCell "Odirniran" == 1
walk 63 3571 -1280
activate 058882EE
wait 60
walk -300 3600 -1251
until 3000 GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran >= 70
end

case hh_odirniran_report
run
player->PositionCell -333 3500 -1251 0 "Odirniran"
until 300 GetPCCell "Odirniran" == 1
approach 05994AFF
talk remasa othril
ask Odirniran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran == 90
bye
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask Odirniran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Odirniran == 100
bye
end
